# 2026-10-03 (W8-B2): whatsapp-bot vendors its built @insureportal/channel-core
# dependency (file: vendor/channel-core) so the bot stays standalone-installable
# (its Docker context is just whatsapp-bot/). The vendored build output must be
# committed. This negation must stay LAST — later generic `dist/` rules would
# re-ignore it (2026-10-03, verify-w8b2 finding; validated via git check-ignore).
!whatsapp-bot/vendor/channel-core/dist/
